t as a big driver of helping businesses increase customer engagement and revenue by being able to run more experiments, being able to optimize the marketing campaigns they're running.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"As discussed last quarter, we expected our NRR to decline from the prior period due to the impact of lapping our September 2022 price increase and the spending trends we discussed on our last call.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-05-08","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Katie Keyser","x":"I appreciate that NRR is impacted by lapping the price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q2","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-08-07","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Andrew Bialecki","x":"They wanted to build out their direct-to-consumer offering, engaging consumers with new content.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/klaviyo-kvyo-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q2","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-08-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Derrick Wood","x":"Andrew, there seems to be top that the AI wave is starting to drive more companies to invest in personalization and the marketing and customer engagement space.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/klaviyo-kvyo-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q2","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-08-07","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"…their existing usage and adding new products, as can be seen in our dollar-based net revenue retention rate, or NRR, which was 112% for the quarter, an expected decline due to the lapping of our September 2022 price increase, as well as the customer trends we spoke about earlier this year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/08/07/klaviyo-kvyo-q2-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Andrew Bialecki","x":"Working with the new Klaviyo partner, Absolute Labs, they did a full strategy review and chose Klaviyo to consolidate from nine different tools to one, enabling greater personalization and streamlining their marketing tech stack.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/klaviyo-kvyo-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2024-11-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"In addition to the customers you heard Andrew speak about, we also partnered with Lulus, a digitally native women's fashion brand that was looking to enhance its tech infrastructure, streamline processes, and improve its reporting capabilities.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/07/klaviyo-kvyo-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q4","e":"kvyo","d":"2025-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"But as of now, we don't expect the tariffs would impact us directly. as you spoke about downstream implications, some of our customers may be impacted.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/19/klaviyo-kvyo-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q4","e":"kvyo","d":"2025-02-19","l":"tariffs","r":"analyst","s":"Mark Zgutowicz","x":"I'm curious on the tariff front, kind of a fluid situation right now.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/19/klaviyo-kvyo-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q4","e":"kvyo","d":"2025-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"And in the spirit of being customer friendly, we are limiting price increases to a maximum of 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/19/klaviyo-kvyo-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2024 Q4","e":"kvyo","d":"2025-02-19","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"And then, for those customers who do see a change, regardless of how many profiles they're storing with us, in the spirit of being customer friendly, we're limiting price increases to a maximum of 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/19/klaviyo-kvyo-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2025 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"Reflecting the power in our operating model and our ability to deliver strong growth while investing to capture an even larger AI-driven opportunity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/klaviyo-kvyo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2025 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"Instead of spending hours pulling data manually, they now have an AI application using our MCP server that reviews last month's performance, summarizes results, and finds campaigns that over or underperformed historical trends, diagnoses the probable causes, and suggests next best actions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/06/klaviyo-kvyo-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2025 Q4","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Andrew Bialecki","x":"First, AI is embedded directly into our infrastructure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/klaviyo-kvyo-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2025 Q4","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-02-10","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Andrew Bialecki","x":"Second, AI sits on top of that infrastructure in the form of agents that do the work of marketing and customer service.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/11/klaviyo-kvyo-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Andrew Bialecki","x":"Our investments in AI are not limited to the agents and infrastructure we build, but extend to how we operate and deliver Klaviyo, Inc. Annualized revenue per full-time employee in Q1 was over $600 thousand, up more than 25% year over year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-05-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"Our model is efficient enough that we can invest aggressively in growing the platform—in AI and agents, in international, in enterprise—and simultaneously return capital to shareholders.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"When you are in the text messaging business, there are carrier fees from the big telco carriers that generally, for many of our competitors, are a pass-through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-05-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"Thus far, we have taken the strategic choice not to pass through those carrier fees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q1","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-05-05","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"Overall, it was an incredibly strong Q1 that gives us confidence looking forward and gave us confidence to raise the outlook for the rest of the year by $13 million, which is even greater than the beat that we had for Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q2","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-08-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Andrew Bialecki","x":"We vertically integrated the data infrastructure, experience infrastructure and the AI and agents to decide which experiences to deliver each consumer to drive better engagement, revenue and growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/klaviyo-kvyo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q2","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"On carrier fees, as we mentioned, we made a change in Q3, and we are now pricing our [ T-Mobile ] business to pass through the carrier fee increases that we have seen to our customers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/klaviyo-kvyo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q2","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Amanda Whalen","x":"Carrier fees are now being passed through.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/klaviyo-kvyo-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-11-04","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Luciano Fernandez Gomez","x":"Including ButcherBox, a direct to consumer meat brand.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Erica E. Smith","x":"As we leaned into the infrastructure optimization and AI efficiencies across the organization.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/klaviyo-kvyo-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"KVYO 2026 Q3","e":"kvyo","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Erica E. Smith","x":"…came in at $56.9 million, a 15% operating margin, exceeding our guidance This reflects expense discipline across the business including infrastructure opt